  fragmentName: Fragment1
  fragmentItemName: Highschooler found dead in a school warehouse
  fragmentItemDetails: xx/xx \nAW (15), a student of Pernaungan Orang Tua High School
    was found unbreathing in her school's warehouse at 6 a.m. Victim was found by
    the school's janitor JA during his early shift, there hadn't been any witnesses
    that came forward to testify. 10 students had been traumatized by this event,
    prompting a mass transfer to neighbouring schools, as well as classes being conducted
    online for the remainder of the year. Victim's body was covered in bruises. However,
    no footages are able to determine what happened exactly. \nThe police had closed
    investigation due to the lack of substantial evidence.
  fragmentPosition: {x: 339.07, y: 0.027, z: 329.71}
